   332		/* Bring the TX stream back to the READY state. When the queued
   333		 * blocks finish playing the DW driver underruns and leaves the
   334		 * stream in I2S_STATE_ERROR (or RUNNING). i2s_configure() only
   335		 * accepts READY/NOT_READY, so without this the next button press
   336		 * would fail with "invalid state" (-EINVAL). I2S_TRIGGER_DROP is
   337		 * valid from any state except NOT_READY and resets it to READY. */
   338		if (trigger_started) {
